Asha Morrow:Asha snorts and approves.

Bell Delatii:Bell smiles and has the woman out from under Asha's nose quickly, treating her like a new friend and helping her to relax on their way back toward the dorms.

![](https://files.d20.io/images/486756473/LrNCmB87c4vuW1tupLerqw/med.png?1778631209)

Yraina:"Sure is nice that you have a whole ship and crew," she comments off-hand. "I'm surprised none of the factions got to you two by now."

"Free pilots are pretty rare."

